Gestão de Operações e Logística I — Rodrigo de Alvarenga Rosa (@cs-rosa: 0, is #reference, #part-of @cs-sources) { r_6J7SWGEMAKMNVKVNGATZW4EB2J
Rodrigo de Alvarenga Rosa, UFSC/CAPES/UAB. Gestão de Operações e Logística I, 2015 edition. [Institutional catalogue and PDF](https://educapes.capes.gov.br/handle/capes/145367) · [Further institutional teaching record](https://educapes.capes.gov.br/handle/capes/719559?mode=full).

Read the complete text, with the service/order, transport, inventory/purchasing and material-handling questions. Use it to develop a Portuguese explanation of a supply system before taking the advanced English readings. Compare editions by their title page and contents rather than treating upload dates as publication dates.

The 2015 institutional record names the author and UFSC; its 17,172,578-byte PDF exceeded the browser limit on 29 October 2026. The later catalogue describes four chapters but is not proof that its file is the identical edition. Preserve the actual downloaded book's notices; no blanket licence is inferred from repository membership. No book is copied here.

